<div class="statusbox applicable"><p class="micro">Tax audit applicability</p><p class="statusword">APPLICABLE</p><p>On the information entered, tax audit under section 44AB of the Income-tax Act, 1961 is applicable to the individual for FY 2025-26 (AY 2026-27).</p></div>
